{"id":1,"name":"EV001","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":0,"characterName":"$Voice-Sheet","direction":2,"pattern":1,"characterIndex":0},"list":[{"code":111,"indent":0,"parameters":[4,5,0]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Evil",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Voice of Naksh-Gongor>You come at the bidding of the Sorcerer-King. He sees potential in you, a harbinger of death that could rival Azrog-Khaan himself."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["KnightPortrait_small",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["It is a great honor to bring forth the will of the Sorcerer-King. May the Fiend be slain as the dog he is."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Evil",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Voice of Naksh-Gongor>The Fiend perverts not just life but the delicate balance of death. His eradication is paramount to restoring the natural order."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Evil",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Voice of Naksh-Gongor>There is an artifact, hidden deep in the western sewers, that we require. Another servant failed to retrieve it, but you will not. Beware the traps and puzzles that guard it. Only those with mastery of the dark arts may proceed..."]},{"code":121,"indent":1,"parameters":[6,6,0]},{"code":356,"indent":1,"parameters":["Quest Journal Open To 3"]},{"code":123,"indent":1,"parameters":["A",0]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":411,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["Evil",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["\\n<Figure without a face>Hmm... You are not one of us. Better go and spend your time better than sitting in someone elses tomb..."]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"